      "id": 1,
      "primary_message": "Place the sugar cube on a small saucer and douse with two or three dashes of bitters. Place the sugar in the bottom of a champagne glass, and fill with sparkling wine (careful—the sugar will make the wine foam, so go slow). Twist a piece of lemon peel over the drink and use as garnish.",
